        {
          "text": "Student Instructions",
          "textSize": "heading-three"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "To begin this lesson, you should have a copy of \"Harlem\" in front of you."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "numbered-list",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "list-item",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Navigate through the lesson's pages, being sure to read/watch/listen to all the items enclosed."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list-item",
          "children": [
            {
              "text": "Periodically, there will be action items "
            },
            {
              "text": "bolded",
              "bold": true
            },
            {
              "text": ". Follow the action item. There will also be "
            },
            {
              "text": "underlined and bolded questions",
              "bold": true,
              "underline": true
            },
            {
              "text": " to which you will respond, using the manner your instructor requires (e.g., Google Doc, notebook and paper)."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "So, to begin….\n"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "children": [
        {
          "text": "Listen to the recording below. "
        },
        {
          "text": "What stands out to you? ",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": "Jot down three (3) specific observations you have about what plays (no need for complete sentences):",
          "bold": true,
          "underline": true
        }
      ]
    },
